 "notes": [
  "No starting section is posted; the strategy says to start the Endor Operations cards, then with Prepared Defenses start Oppressive Enforcement, Something Special Planned For Them and Power Of The Hutt (or You Cannot Hide Forever, which is not in the list). Several Effects start, so starting.effect is empty.",
  "Character header says 20 but the list adds to 19; 'Reds (22)' covers 24 cards with the Admiral's Orders and Objective listed under it. Total 60 as published.",
  "Posted '3 R2-A5 (Arfour-Emmnine)' is left UNKNOWN: R2-A5 is R2-A5 (Artoo-Ayfive) (Special Edition) but 'Arfour-Emmnine' is R4-M9 (Premiere); both are Dark droids, so the card meant can't be told.",
  "Oppressive Enforcement is the Special Edition Effect in February 2001 (not the Reflections III Defensive Shield). Posted 'Thrawn' dested Grand Admiral Thrawn; 'palleon' Captain Gilad Pellaeon; 'Captain Godhert' Captain Godherdt; 'Perimiter Patrol' Perimeter Patrol; 'Alert My Star Destroyer' Alert My Star Destroyer!.",
